#: src/postulo/plugins/messaging_contacts/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Keep the ways you and the people you deal with are reached on Matrix, XMPP, Signal, Telegram, Threema or another messaging service, as many as you like, one of them marked as the one to use. Switched off, Postulo offers none; the ones already recorded stay and come back untouched when it is switched on again."
msgstr "Haalt d'Weeër, iwwer déi Dir an d'Leit, mat deenen Dir ze dinn hutt, op Matrix, XMPP, Signal, Telegram, Threema oder engem anere Messagerie-Déngscht erreechbar sidd, esou vill wéi Dir wëllt, an eent dovun als dat markéiert, dat benotzt gëtt. Ausgeschalt, bitt de Postulo keng un; déi, déi scho gespäichert sinn, bleiwen a kommen onverännert zréck, wann en erëm ugeschalt gëtt."

#: src/postulo/plugins/messaging_contacts/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Multiple messaging contacts"
msgstr "Méi Messagerie-Kontakter"
